  "ingredients": [
    "4 eggs",
    "0.25 cup white sugar",
    "0.25 cup vegetable oil",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1 teaspoon baking powder",
    "0.25 cup all-purpose flour, or as needed",
    "2 cups vegetable oil for frying, or as needed",
    "0.5 cup honey, or more to taste",
    "0.5 cup white sugar, or more to taste",
    "1 tablespoon rainbow nonpareil sprinkles, or to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HlK0FQKg54YjnCwIGDH8lfTKdsE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-240639-struffoli-VAT-step-01-5e0954156c7b416386c412388de26d51.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240639/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat eggs, 1/4 cup white sugar, 1/4 cup vegetable oil, and vanilla extract together in a bowl; stir in baking powder.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3Qeu5kD_5i1vuvHZujbRFekmc4k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-240639-struffoli-VAT-step-02-0192175a6c70475ca29e26bd9bf6007b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240639/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slowly stir flour into egg mixture, about 1 tablespoon at a time, adding more flour if needed, until the dough is firm enough to roll into balls.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GvB2MzsK0iDjRlAFBnEqo8PX5jY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-240639-struffoli-VAT-step-03-92b3c77d7aa14ee39af985a247cc922c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240639/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll dough into small balls.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_SDl18hLs1z4Nokcp97yDkfkAac=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-240639-struffoli-VAT-step-04-507542b618424304abd768769d74286f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240639/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat 2 cups vegetable oil in a large saucepan to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C) or until you see little waves on the bottom of the saucepan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3BRW8BLKpA1e9gJKc5-ocWqU-dQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-240639-struffoli-VAT-step-05-aff69efd02c2453c9bfbdc54b85cb083.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240639/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Working in small batches, fry dough balls in hot oil until lightly browned, 2 to 3 minutes per batch. Transfer struffoli to a paper towel-lined plate using a slotted spoon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VwBQY5mBFISTPOGYVm-_Ih9nvso=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-240639-struffoli-VAT-step-06-e928cdf98cc043a5a4d10724c443b44f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240639/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the sweet glaze: Heat honey in a saucepan over medium-low heat. Slowly mix 1/2 cup sugar, a few tablespoons at a time, into honey until sugar is melted and glaze is smooth, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HqTW1bJ_-NBxopUgXaeSoRuM33k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-240639-struffoli-VAT-step-07-1ce4499a74334e8786f47aad2bac5e2b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240639/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer struffoli to a large bowl and pour glaze on top; toss quickly to evenly coat before glaze hardens.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ri6OcK1Tyw3YDbyq1UrJC9iIdlE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-240639-struffoli-VAT-step-08-fb0a96de8fd047ed9dfd7b202155751e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240639/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange struffoli into a tower shape or Christmas tree shape on a serving plate. Sprinkle nonpareil sprinkles over struffoli.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zFr-rhnOl8M0YJN6DOJtYlbVL-g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-240639-struffoli-VAT-step-09-9c073791187d445f9931c44b4336f897.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240639/step_09.webp"
    }
  ],
